ValDroid is an unofficial, community-developed compatibility launcher for running
the Linux x86_64 version of Valheim on ARM64 Android devices. It grew out of
RimDroid (github.com/udarmolota/RimDroid) by the same author.

Using ValDroid requires the user's own copy of Valheim. Valheim and its related
names and trademarks belong to Iron Gate AB; the game is published by Coffee Stain
Publishing. ValDroid is not affiliated with, endorsed by or supported by Iron Gate
or Coffee Stain, and it contains no game files.

